Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] mfd: mediatek: support MT6897 SPMI PMICs and IRQ lifecycle

Support MT6363, MT6368 and MT6685 child devices. Correct IRQ allocation,
masking, reset and status acknowledgement for the SPMI controller.

